ecordWait(), milliseconds(100));","+}","+"," // The two keys stay independent. Configs in the wild already set the CUPTI one,"," // so letting it reach the rocprof path would enable it on every ROCm run."," TEST(ParseTest, CuptiPerThreadBufferDoesNotEnableRocprof) {",""],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":117,"deletions":0,"truncated":false,"file_count":8},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-31T14:36:11.043058+00:00"}